 <h2 class="h2s">An MDR built for <em>business resilience</em></h2>
 <div class="val3"><div ><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14v-2a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v2"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="4" height="6" rx="1.5"/><rect x="17" y="14" width="4" height="6" rx="1.5"/></svg></span><h3>A 24\xD77\xD7365 SOC at your disposal</h3><p>Round-the-clock monitoring by a dedicated analyst team extends your security effectiveness while your IT team focuses on the business.</p></div><div ><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3 9 5-9 5-9-5z"/><path d="m3 13 9 5 9-5"/></svg></span><h3>Remediation that includes recovery and patching</h3><p>Business continuity through integrated rollback, restore and patch management \u2014 fully handled for you on the Advanced tier.</p></div><div ><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 12s3.5-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3.5 7-10 7S2 12 2 12z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg></span><h3>Prioritised threats on one platform</h3><p>One view of incidents across security, backup and endpoint management \u2014 prioritised, so the critical ones are handled first.</p></div></div>

 <h2 class="h2s" id="why">Why outsource <em>your security operations?</em></h2>
 <div class="why5"><div ><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.5"/><path d="M2 20c0-4 3-6 7-6s7 2 7 6"/><path d="M16 4.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7M18 14c2.5.6 4 2.6 4 6"/></svg></span><h3>The talent gap</h3><p>Security analysts are scarce and expensive, and 24\xD77 shifts need several of them. MDR gives you the whole team for a per-device fee.</p></div><div ><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg></span><h3>Attacks happen out of hours</h3><p>Ransomware is often launched at night and on weekends, when nobody&#39;s watching the console. MDR is watching.</p></div><div ><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3 2 20h20z"/><path d="M12 10v4M12 17.5v.5"/></svg></span><h3>Alert fatigue</h3><p>Tools produce hundreds of alerts. Analysts separate the real incident from the noise and act on it.</p></div><div ><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 4h12M6 9h12M9 4c6 0 6 10 0 10H6l9 7"/></svg></span><h3>Predictable cost</h3><p>A monthly per-workload fee replaces salaries, tools, training and attrition \u2014 with no hiring risk.</p></div><div ><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v18M5 21h14M4 7h16M7 7l-3 7a3 3 0 0 0 6 0zM17 7l-3 7a3 3 0 0 0 6 0z"/></svg></span><h3>Compliance &amp; insurance</h3><p>Documented 24\xD77 monitoring and incident reports support DPDP Act, RBI/SEBI expectations and cyber-insurance questionnaires.</p></div></div>

