  <p style="color:var(--slate);margin:-8px 0 26px;max-width:880px">What happens from the moment something suspicious appears on one of your devices \u2014 follow an incident through the service.</p>
  <ol class="wf" id="wf" [class.playing]="timelinePlaying()"><span class="bar" id="wfBar"></span><li><span class="dot"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 15c-1.5 1.5-2 5-2 5s3.5-.5 5-2M9 11a13 13 0 0 1 11-8 13 13 0 0 1-8 11l-3-3z"/><circle cx="15" cy="9" r="1.5"/></svg></span><div><span class="t">Day 0</span><h3>Effortless provisioning</h3><p>We enable the service on your Acronis tenant and deploy the agent; the SOC takes over onboarding and baselining.</p></div></li><li><span class="dot"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 12s3.5-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3.5 7-10 7S2 12 2 12z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg></span><div><span class="t">T + 0 min</span><h3>Continuous monitoring</h3><p>24\xD77\xD7365 monitoring of every protected endpoint, identifying and analysing threats in real time.</p></div></li><li><span class="dot"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-4-4"/></svg></span><div><span class="t">T + 5 min</span><h3>Analyst-led investigation</h3><p>Analysts investigate and prioritise incidents using telemetry, threat intelligence and forensic evidence.</p></div></li><li><span class="dot"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 2 4 14h7l-1 8 9-12h-7z"/></svg></span><div><span class="t">T + 15 min</span><h3>Triage &amp; rapid response</h3><p>Real-time alerting with a clear analysis, immediate containment such as isolation, and continuous reporting.</p></div></li><li><span class="dot"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3 9 5-9 5-9-5z"/><path d="m3 13 9 5 9-5"/></svg></span><div><span class="t">T + 45 min</span><h3>Integrated recovery &amp; patching</h3><p>Remediation, rollback, restore from backup and patching \u2014 delivered by us on Advanced, or one click away on Standard.</p></div></li></ol>
