 <h2 class="mdr-section-label" id="cases">Case studies</h2>
 <div class="cases cases2"><article class="case">
  <div class="case-hd"><span class="case-av">LC</span><div><h3>A dormant infostealer found and removed within hours of onboarding</h3><small>Logistics company \xB7 Transport \xB7 Chennai<span class="case-tag">Illustrative case study</span></small></div></div>
  <div class="case-body"><div><h4>Challenge</h4><p>A fake &#39;verify you&#39;re human&#39; page had tricked two staff into running a command weeks earlier. An infostealer sat quietly on their laptops, collecting browser passwords, undetected by the old antivirus.</p></div><div><h4>What we did</h4><p>Within hours of XcellHost MDR going live, analysts flagged the persistence mechanism, isolated both laptops, removed the malware, reset the exposed accounts and hunted the rest of the estate for the same indicators.</p></div>
