    args: [{ selector: "xh-rtx-pro-6000-details", standalone: true, changeDetection: ChangeDetectionStrategy13.OnPush, template: '<section class="rtx-pro-6000-details" aria-label="RTX PRO 6000 features and benefits">\n<h2 class="pp-sec">Key features of RTX PRO 6000 on XcellHost</h2>\n <div class="pp-feats"><div class="pp-feat"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6" y="6" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5"/><rect x="9.5" y="9.5" width="5" height="5"/><path d="M9 2v4M15 2v4M9 18v4M15 18v4M2 9h4M2 15h4M18 9h4M18 15h4"/></svg></span><p><b>AI and graphics on one card</b>Fine-tune a 30B-parameter model in the morning and render a path-traced scene in the afternoon \u2014 no second fleet to buy or manage.</p></div><div class="pp-feat"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 2 4 14h7l-1 8 9-12h-7z"/></svg></span><p><b>FP4 precision for cheaper inference</b>Blackwell&#39;s FP4 Tensor Cores roughly double tokens-per-rupee on quantised models compared with FP8 on the previous generation.</p></div><div class="pp-feat"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3 9 5-9 5-9-5z"/><path d="m3 13 9 5 9-5"/></svg></span><p><b>Slice it with MIG</b>Split one GPU into up to four isolated instances with dedicated memory \u2014 ideal for dev teams, notebooks and small inference endpoints.</p></div><div class="pp-feat"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3 4 6v6c0 5 3.5 8 8 9 4.5-1 8-4 8-9V6z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><p><b>Confidential by design</b>Secure boot, hardware root of trust and confidential computing keep model weights and customer data sealed \u2014 useful for DPDP Act obligations.</p></div><div class="pp-feat"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 0 1 0 18M12 3a14 14 0 0 0 0 18"/></svg></span><p><b>India-hosted, low latency</b>Serve users across India from our Mumbai-region data centres without overseas round trips.</p></div><div class="pp-feat"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 18a9 9 0 1 1 16 0"/><path d="m12 13 4-5"/></svg></span><p><b>Live GPU monitoring</b>Track utilisation, memory and temperature from the portal and get alerts before jobs slow down.</p></div><div class="pp-feat"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 4h12M6 9h12M9 4c6 0 6 10 0 10H6l9 7"/></svg></span><p><b>Hourly or term billing</b>Run a proof of concept by the hour, then save up to 10% on a 1-year term.</p></div><div class="pp-feat"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14v-2a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v2"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="4" height="6" rx="1.5"/><rect x="17" y="14" width="4" height="6" rx="1.5"/></svg></span><p><b>Experts on call</b>Our engineers help tune vLLM, TensorRT and render settings for the best throughput.</p></div></div>\n\n <h2 class="pp-sec">Why choose XcellHost for your RTX PRO 6000 cloud GPU</h2>\n <div class="pp-bens"><div class="pp-ben"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 0 1 0 18M12 3a14 14 0 0 0 0 18"/></svg></span><h3>Hosted in India</h3><p>GPUs run in Indian data centres, so latency stays low and your data stays in the country for DPDP Act comfort.</p></div><div class="pp-ben"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 4h12M6 9h12M9 4c6 0 6 10 0 10H6l9 7"/></svg></span><h3>INR billing with GST invoice</h3><p>Pay in rupees and claim input tax credit \u2014 no forex swings or USD card charges.</p></div><div class="pp-ben"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 18a9 9 0 1 1 16 0"/><path d="m12 13 4-5"/></svg></span><h3>99.95% uptime SLA</h3><p>Enterprise power, cooling and network with a written uptime commitment.</p></div><div class="pp-ben"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14v-2a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v2"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="4" height="6" rx="1.5"/><rect x="17" y="14" width="4" height="6" rx="1.5"/></svg></span><h3>24\xD77 human GPU experts</h3><p>Real engineers on phone, WhatsApp and ticket \u2014 in English and Hindi.</p></div><div class="pp-ben"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 15c-1.5 1.5-2 5-2 5s3.5-.5 5-2M9 11a13 13 0 0 1 11-8 13 13 0 0 1-8 11l-3-3z"/><circle cx="15" cy="9" r="1.5"/></svg></span><h3>Free setup &amp; migration</h3><p>We install drivers, CUDA and frameworks, and move your data and images for you.</p></div><div class="pp-ben"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3 9 5-9 5-9-5z"/><path d="m3 13 9 5 9-5"/></svg></span><h3>Scale 1 \u2192 4 GPUs</h3><p>Start with one GPU for a proof of concept and add more as projects grow.</p></div><div class="pp-ben"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3 4 6v6c0 5 3.5 8 8 9 4.5-1 8-4 8-9V6z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><h3>ISO 27001 security</h3><p>Certified operations, virtual firewall, anti-DDoS and Acronis endpoint protection.</p></div><div class="pp-ben"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><path d="M3 7V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11v3"/><circle cx="16.5" cy="13.5" r="1.2"/></svg></span><h3>No surprise bills</h3><p>Flat plans include storage, a public IP and bandwidth \u2014 no hidden egress charges.</p></div></div>\n\n <h2 class="pp-sec">Outcomes you can plan around</h2>\n <div class="outs"><div class="out"><b data-count="2" data-pre="" data-suf="\xD7">2\xD7</b><h3>Bigger models per GPU</h3><p>96