 2- and 4-GPU plans</b>Bridged in pairs so renderers and training jobs share memory at high speed.</p></div><div class="pp-feat"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 18a9 9 0 1 1 16 0"/><path d="m12 13 4-5"/></svg></span><p><b>Live GPU monitoring</b>Utilisation, memory and temperature dashboards with alerting.</p></div><div class="pp-feat"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 4h12M6 9h12M9 4c6 0 6 10 0 10H6l9 7"/></svg></span><p><b>Hourly or term billing</b>Burst hourly for survey season or deadlines; save up to 10% on a 1-year term.</p></div><div class="pp-feat"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14v-2a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v2"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="4" height="6" rx="1.5"/><rect x="17" y="14" width="4" height="6" rx="1.5"/></svg></span><p><b>Experts on call</b>Help with drivers, CUDA versions, KeyShot, V-Ray and PyTorch setup.</p></div></div>\n\n <h2 class="pp-sec">Why choose XcellHost for your RTX A6000 cloud GPU</h2>\n <div class="pp-bens"><div class="pp-ben"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 0 1 0 18M12 3a14 14 0 0 0 0 18"/></svg></span><h3>Hosted in India</h3><p>GPUs run in Indian data centres, so latency stays low and your data stays in the country for DPDP Act comfort.</p></div><div class="pp-ben"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 4h12M6 9h12M9 4c6 0 6 10 0 10H6l9 7"/></svg></span><h3>INR billing with GST invoice</h3><p>Pay in rupees and claim input tax credit \u2014 no forex swings or USD card charges.</p></div><div class="pp-ben"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 18a9 9 0 1 1 16 0"/><path d="m12 13 4-5"/></svg></span><h3>99.95% uptime SLA</h3><p>Enterprise power, cooling and network with a written uptime commitment.</p></div><div class="pp-ben"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14v-2a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v2"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="4" height="6" rx="1.5"/><rect x="17" y="14" width="4" height="6" rx="1.5"/></svg></span><h3>24\xD77 human GPU experts</h3><p>Real engineers on phone, WhatsApp and ticket \u2014 in English and Hindi.</p></div><div class="pp-ben"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 15c-1.5 1.5-2 5-2 5s3.5-.5 5-2M9 11a13 13 0 0 1 11-8 13 13 0 0 1-8 11l-3-3z"/><circle cx="15" cy="9" r="1.5"/></svg></span><h3>Free setup &amp; migration</h3><p>We install drivers, CUDA and frameworks, and move your data and images for you.</p></div><div class="pp-ben"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3 9 5-9 5-9-5z"/><path d="m3 13 9 5 9-5"/></svg></span><h3>Scale 1 \u2192 4 GPUs</h3><p>Start with one GPU for a proof of concept and add more as projects grow.</p></div><div class="pp-ben"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3 4 6v6c0 5 3.5 8 8 9 4.5-1 8-4 8-9V6z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><h3>ISO 27001 security</h3><p>Certified operations, virtual firewall, anti-DDoS and Acronis endpoint protection.</p></div><div class="pp-ben"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><path d="M3 7V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11v3"/><circle cx="16.5" cy="13.5" r="1.2"/></svg></span><h3>No surprise bills</h3><p>Flat plans include storage, a public IP and bandwidth \u2014 no hidden egress charges.</p></div></div>\n\n <h2 class="pp-sec">Outcomes you can plan around</h2>\n <div class="outs"><div class="out"><b data-count="96" data-pre="" data-suf=" GB">96 GB</b><h3>Pooled with NVLink</h3><p>Bridge two A6000s for large scenes and bigger training batches.</p></div><div class="out"><b data-count="2.4" data-pre="" data-suf="\xD7">2.4\xD7</b><h3>FP32 over Quadro RTX 6000</h3><p>38.7 versus 16.3 TFLOPS for faster renders and simulations.</p></div><div class="out"><b data-count="3" data-pre="" data-suf="rd-gen">3rd-gen</b><h3>Tensor cores with BF16</h3><p>Train and fine-tune modern vision and language models natively.</p></div><div class="out"><b data-count="48900" data-pre="\u20B9" data-suf="">\u20B948900</b><h3>Monthly entry price</h3><p>A 48 GB Ampere GPU for less than a workstation lease, excl. GST.</p></div></div>\n <p class="note">Ratios are based on NVIDIA&#39;s published specifications. Actual results depend on your workload.</p>\n\n </section>\r\n<section class="rtx-pro-specifications" aria-label="RTX A6000 specifications">\r\n<h2 class="h2s" id="specs">What are the <em>NVIDIA RTX A6000</em> specifications?</h2>\n <div class="explore">\n  <div class="explore__card" id="xgHs">\n<svg class="gc" viewBox="0 0 640 300" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of the NVIDIA RTX A6000 graphics card">\n <defs>\n  <linearGradient id="ebody" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#353b48"/><stop offset=".55" stop-color="#1a1d24"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#0c0e13"/></linearGradient>\n  <linearGradient id="emetal" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#8d96a8"/><stop offset=".5" stop-color="#d9dee8"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#7a8396"/></linearGradient>\n  <linearGradient id="efin" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#b9c2d4"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#1a1f2b"/></linearGradient>\n  <linearGradient id="esheen" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#fff" stop-opacity="0"/><stop offset=".5" stop-color="#fff" stop-opacity=".28"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#fff" stop-opacity="0"/></linearGradient>\n  <radialGradient id="ehub"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#3a4253"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#0d1118"/></radialGradient>\n  <clipPath id="eclip"><rect x="30" y="26" width="590" height