    args: [{ selector: "xh-rtx-8000-details", standalone: true, changeDetection: ChangeDetectionStrategy16.OnPush, template: '<section class="rtx-8000-details" aria-label="RTX 8000 features and benefits">\r\n<h2 class="pp-sec">Key features of RTX 8000 on XcellHost</h2>\n <div class="pp-feats"><div class="pp-feat"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 14a4 4 0 0 0 5.7 0l3-3a4 4 0 0 0-5.7-5.7l-1 1"/><path d="M14 10a4 4 0 0 0-5.7 0l-3 3a4 4 0 0 0 5.7 5.7l1-1"/></svg></span><p><b>NVLink memory pooling</b>Bridge two cards to share 96 GB \u2014 renderers like V-Ray and Redshift treat them as one large memory pool.</p></div><div class="pp-feat"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><path d="M3 7V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11v3"/><circle cx="16.5" cy="13.5" r="1.2"/></svg></span><p><b>The most affordable 48 GB</b>Get the memory headroom of a flagship at a fraction of the monthly cost \u2014 right for steady render queues.</p></div><div class="pp-feat"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.9 4.9l1.4 1.4M17.7 17.7l1.4 1.4M2 12h2M20 12h2M4.9 19.1l1.4-1.4M17.7 6.3l1.4-1.4"/></svg></span><p><b>RTX ray tracing</b>72 RT cores and 11 GRays/s accelerate OptiX-based renderers and interactive previews.</p></div><div class="pp-feat"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m2 9 10-5 10 5-10 5z"/><path d="M6 11v5c3 2.5 9 2.5 12 0v-5M22 9v6"/></svg></span><p><b>Great for labs and classrooms</b>Colleges and training institutes can give every student a pro GPU desktop without a hardware refresh.</p></div><div class="pp-feat"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3 9 5-9 5-9-5z"/><path d="m3 13 9 5 9-5"/></svg></span><p><b>Render-queue ready</b>Deadline, Backburner and Flamenco setups with shared NVMe project storage.</p></div><div class="pp-feat"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m2 9 10-5 10 5-10 5z"/><path d="M6 11v5c3 2.5 9 2.5 12 0v-5M22 9v6"/></svg></span><p><b>Lab scheduling</b>Timetable-based access so a class of students shares GPUs fairly.</p></div><div class="pp-feat"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 4h12M6 9h12M9 4c6 0 6 10 0 10H6l9 7"/></svg></span><p><b>Lowest 48 GB price</b>The most affordable way to get 48 GB of professional GPU memory.</p></div><div class="pp-feat"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14v-2a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v2"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="4" height="6" rx="1.5"/><rect x="17" y="14" width="4" height="6" rx="1.5"/></svg></span><p><b>Experts on call</b>Help with V-Ray, Corona, Redshift and OptiX tuning.</p></div></div>\n\n <h2 class="pp-sec">Why choose XcellHost for your RTX 8000 cloud GPU</h2>\n <div class="pp-bens"><div class="pp-ben"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 0 1 0 18M12 3a14 14 0 0 0 0 18"/></svg></span><h3>Hosted in India</h3><p>GPUs run in Indian data centres, so latency stays low and your data stays in the country for DPDP Act comfort.</p></div><div class="pp-ben"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 4h12M6 9h12M9 4c6 0 6 10 0 10H6l9 7"/></svg></span><h3>INR billing with GST invoice</h3><p>Pay in rupees and claim input tax credit \u2014 no forex swings or USD card charges.</p></div><div class="pp-ben"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 18a9 9 0 1 1 16 0"/><path d="m12 13 4-5"/></svg></span><h3>99.95% uptime SLA</h3><p>Enterprise power, cooling and network with a written uptime commitment.</p></div><div class="pp-ben"><span 