    args: [{ selector: "xh-rtx-6000-ada-showcase", standalone: true, changeDetection: ChangeDetectionStrategy23.OnPush, template: '<section class="rtx-use-cases" aria-label="RTX 6000 Ada use cases and supported platforms">\r\n<h2 class="pp-sec">Use cases</h2>\n <div class="pp-feats"><div class="pp-feat"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 2 9 5v10l-9 5-9-5V7z"/><path d="m3 7 9 5 9-5M12 12v10"/></svg></span><p><b>3D &amp; CAD</b>SolidWorks, CATIA, Revit and Inventor assemblies that choke laptops.</p></div><div class="pp-feat"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"/><path d="m12 8 1.5 2.5L16 12l-2.5 1.5L12 16l-1.5-2.5L8 12l2.5-1.5z"/></svg></span><p><b>Rendering &amp; visualisation</b>V-Ray, Arnold, Redshift, Enscape and Twinmotion for architecture and ads.</p></div><div class="pp-feat"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4"/></svg></span><p><b>Virtual workstations</b>Remote desks for design teams across branches and freelancers.</p></div><div class="pp-feat"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 4a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-2 5 3 3 0 0 0 2 5 3 3 0 0 0 3 3 3 3 0 0 0 3-3V7a3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"/><path d="M15 4a3 3 0 0 1 3 3 3 3 0 0 1 2 5 3 3 0 0 1-2 5 3 3 0 0 1-3 3 3 3 0 0 1-3-3"/></svg></span><p><b>AI &amp; ML</b>Training and inference for vision, diffusion and small language models.</p></div><div class="pp-feat"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 3h6M10 3v6L4 19a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.3 2h13.4A1.5 1.5 0 0 0 20 19l-6-10V3"/><path d="M7 15h10"/></svg></span><p><b>Simulation</b>Ansys, COMSOL and engineering compute with ECC memory.</p></div><div class="pp-feat"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M7 4v16M17 4v16M3 9h4M3 15h4M17 9h4M17 15h4"/></svg></span><p><b>Video editing</b>8K timelines, colour grading and effects in Resolve and Premiere.</p></div><div class="pp-feat"><span class="ic"><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3 9 5-9 5-9-5z"/><path d="m3 13 9 5 9-5"/></svg></span><p><b>Mixed pipelines</b>Hybrid 3D, render and AI jobs on one instance.</p></div></div>\n\n <h2 class="pp-sec">Platforms &amp; workloads covered</h2>\n <div class="tiles"><div ><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 4v16"/></svg>Windows Server</div><div ><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3c-2.5 0-3.5 2-3.5 5 0 2-2 4-3 7-.5 2 1 4 3 4h7c2 0 3.5-2 3-4-1-3-3-5-3-7 0-3-1-5-3.5-5z"/><path d="M10 8h.01M14 8h.01"/></svg>Ubuntu Linux</div><div ><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3 9 5-9 5-9-5z"/><path d="m3 13 9 5 9-5"/></svg>Docker</div><div ><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 2 9 5v10l-9 5-9-5V7z"/><path d="m3 7 9 5 9-5M12 12v10"/></svg>Kubernetes</div><div ><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m8 8-5 4 5 4M16 8l5 4-5 4M14 5l-4 14"/></svg>Jupyter</div><div ><svg class="xg-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 0 1 0 18M12 3a14 14 0 0 0 0 18"/></svg>Any browser (RDP/DCV)</div></div>\n\n </section>\r\n<section class="rtx-stories" aria-label="RTX 6000 Ada case studies and GPU comparison">\r\n<h2 class="pp-sec" id="cases">Case studies \u2014 what teams achieve</h2>\n <div class="cases"><article class="case">\n  <div class="case-hd"><span class="case-av">AI</span><div><h3>Ray-traced client walkthroughs from any laptop, in any site office</h3><small>Architecture &amp; interiors firm, 60 staff \xB7 Architecture \xB7 Ahmedabad<span class="case-tag">Illustrative case study</span></small></div></div>\n  <div class="case-body">\n   <div><h4>Challenge</h4><p>Designers across three offices each needed a high-end workstation for Revit and Enscape. Laptops couldn&#39;t open the largest hospital project, and ageing towers took hours per walkthrough render.</p></div>\n   <div><h4>What we set up</h4><p>Twelve XG.ADA6K.1-16 virtual workstations with NICE DCV, a shared file server in the same zone, and one golden Windows image with licensed software.</p><p class="case-plan">Configuration: <b>12 \xD7 XG.ADA6K.1-16 on a 12-month term</b></p></div>\n   <div class="case-res"><div><b data-count="70" data-pre="" data-suf="%">70%</b><span>shorter walkthrough render time</span></div><div><b data-count="15" data-pre="" data-suf=" min">15 min</b><span>to onboard a new designer</span></div><div><b data-count="3" data-pre="" data-suf="">3</b><span>offices on one design platform</span></div></div>\n  </div></article><article class="case">\n  <div class="case-hd"><span class="case-av">EE</span><div><h3>Plant-design reviews without shipping workstations to project sites</h3><small>EPC engineering consultancy \xB7 Engineering \xB7 Chennai<span class="case-tag">Illustrative case study</span></small></div></div>\n  <div class="case-body">\n   <div><h4>Challenge</h4><p>Project engineers at client sites needed to review 3D plant models in real time. Moving heavy files over site connections was slow and exposed IP on laptops.</p></div>\n   <div><h4>What we set up</h4><p>XG.ADA6K.1-24 workstations with Navisworks and Plant 3D, files kept in the data centre, and zero-trust access from site laptops.</p><p class="case-plan">Configuration: <b>8 \xD7 XG.ADA6K.1-24 on a 6-month term</b></p></div>\n   <div class="case-res"><div><b data-count="0" data-pre="" data-suf="">0</b><span>project files stored on site laptops</span></div><div><b data-count="4" data-pre="" data-suf="\xD7">4\xD7</b><span>faster model open times</span></div><div><b data-count="45" data-pre="" data-suf="%">45%</b><span>less spent than buying workstations</span></div></div>\n  </div></article><article class="case">\n  <div class="case-hd"><span class="case-av">DF</span><div><h3>AI product imagery at catalogue scale</h3><small>D2C fashion brand \xB7 E-commerce \xB7 Delhi NCR<span class="case-tag">Illustrative case study</span></small></div></div>\n  <div class="case-body">\n   <div><h4>Challenge</h4><p>The brand shot thousands of SKUs a month. Photo shoots for every colourway were slow and costly, and first diffusion experiments on consumer GPUs couldn&#39;t keep up.</p></div>\n   <div><h4>What we set up</h4><p>A 2-GPU XG.ADA6K.2-32 node running a fine-tuned SDXL pipeline with background replacement, triggered from their PIM system through an API.</p><p class="case-plan">Configuration: <b>1 \xD7 XG.ADA6K.2-32, monthly</b></p></div>\n   <div class="case-res"><div><b data-count="5" data-pre="" data-suf="\xD7">5\xD7</b><span>more catalogue images per week</span></div><div><b data-count="60" data-pre="" data-suf="%">60%</b><span>lower cost per product image</span></div><div><b data-count="2" data-pre="" data-suf=" days">2 days</b><span>from launch brief to live listing</span></div></div>\n  </div></article></div>\n\n <h2 class="pp-sec">Compare professional GPUs</h2>\n <div class="gsw"><a class="gcard" href="/rtx-pro-6000">\n  <div class="img">\n<svg class="gc" viewBox="0 0 640 300" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of the NVIDIA RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell graphics card">\n <defs>\n  <linearGradient id="s1body" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#3a404d"/><stop offset=".55" stop-color="#20242d"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#11141a"/></linearGradient>\n  <linearGradient id="s1metal" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#8d96a8"/><stop offset=".5" stop-color="#d9dee8"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#7a8396"/></linearGradient>\n  <linearGradient id="s1fin" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><s