 students&#39; laptops.</p><p class="case-plan">Configuration: <b>20 \xD7 XG.RTX8K.1-8 on a 12-month term</b></p></div>\n   <div class="case-res"><div><b>60</b><span>students on pro GPUs</span></div><div><b>65%</b><span>lower cost than a lab refresh</span></div><div><b>24\xD77</b><span>access for project work</span></div></div>\n  </div></article><article class="case">\n  <div class="case-hd"><span class="case-av">CE</span><div><h3>Large BIM and point-cloud models for metro projects</h3><small>Civil engineering consultancy \xB7 Infrastructure \xB7 Mumbai<span class="case-tag">Illustrative case study</span></small></div></div>\n  <div class="case-body">\n   <div><h4>Challenge</h4><p>Engineers worked with laser-scanned point clouds of metro stations that exceeded their workstations&#39; memory, forcing them to split models and lose context.</p></div>\n   <div><h4>What we set up</h4><p>XG.RTX8K.1-16 workstations with Revit, Recap and Navisworks, next to a high-throughput file store in the same zone.</p><p class="case-plan">Configuration: <b>6 \xD7 XG.RTX8K.1-16, monthly</b></p></div>\n   <div class="case-res"><div><b>1</b><span>federated model instead of 9 splits</span></div><div><b>50%</b><span>faster clash-detection runs</span></div><div><b>\u20B90</b><span>hardware capex</span></div></div>\n  </div></article></div>\n\n <h2 class="pp-sec">Compare professional GPUs</h2>\n <div class="gsw"><a class="gcard" routerLink="/rtx-pro-6000">\n  <div class="img">\n<svg class="gc" viewBox="0 0 640 300" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of the NVIDIA RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell graphics card">\n <defs>\n  <linearGradient id="s1body" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#3a404d"/><stop offset=".55" stop-color="#20242d"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#11141a"/></linearGradient>\n  <linearGradient id="s1metal" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#8d96a8"/><stop offset=".5" stop-color="#d9dee8"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#7a8396"/></linearGradi