 your favourite apps, helping you do more, faster.</p></div><div class="card"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 10L12 5 2 10l10 5 10-5z"/><path d="M6 12v5c0 1 2.7 3 6 3s6-2 6-3v-5"/></svg></span><h3>Continue learning</h3><p>Get access to additional content, learning opportunities and resources on Microsoft Learn.</p></div></div></div></section>\r\n\r\n<section class="training-section" id="apps"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h"><div class="eyebrow">Across your apps</div><h2>Copilot in the tools you use every day</h2><p>Training covers common prompt flows across Word, Excel, PowerPoint, Teams, Outlook and Copilot Chat \u2014 including the difference between work- and web-grounded data.</p></div><div class="grid3"><div class="seccard"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8l-6-6z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h8"/></svg></span><h3>Word</h3><p>Draft, rewrite and summarise documents \u2014 from a blank page to a polished draft in seconds.</p></div><div class="seccard"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 15l4-4 3 3 5-6"/></svg></span><h3>Excel</h3><p>Analyse data, spot trends, build formulas and generate charts with a plain-English prompt.</p></div><div class="seccard"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18M9 21V9"/></svg></span><h3>PowerPoint</h3><p>Turn a document or a prompt into a designed dec