cap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><rect x="9" y="9" width="6" height="6"/><path d="M9 1v3M15 1v3M9 20v3M15 20v3M1 9h3M1 15h3M20 9h3M20 15h3"/></svg> Build my site free<span class="sh"></span></a></div><div class="bh-panel " style="--d:.1s"><span class="bh-tag blue"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/></svg> App Platform</span><h3>Deploy code, not servers.</h3><p>India\u2019s Heroku alternative. Deploy from GitHub or push a build with a deploy token \u2014 Node.js, Python, Go and more, PostgreSQL included. From \u20B9100/month.</p><div class="bh-term"><div class="bh-bar dark"><i style="background:#FF5F57"></i><i style="background:#FEBC2E"></i><i style="background:#28C840"></i><span>terminal</span></div><div class="bh-code"><div class="bl">$ git push origin main</div><div class="bl g">----&gt; GitHub webhook received</div><div class="bl g">----&gt; Node.js app detected</div><div class="bl g">----&gt; Building application\u2026</div><div class="bl g">----&gt; Zero-downtime deploy\u2026</div><div class="bl g">----&gt; Live over HTTPS on your app URL</div><div class="bl ok">Deploy complete \u2713</div></div></div><a class="btn btn-blue mag" routerLink="/contact"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/></svg> Deploy an app<span class="sh"></span></a></div></div></div></section>\r
