</span>24\xD77 NOC monitoring with smart hands on site around the clock.</td><td class="ct-c">On-site support availability and response times depend on the provider.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section>\r\n<section class="pp-sec " id="benefits"><div class="wrap">\r\n<div class="sec-h "><div class="eyebrow">Key benefits</div>\r\n<h2>Built for performance and continuity.</h2><p>Co-Location lets you keep control of your hardware while we deliver the power, cooling, security and connectivity of an enterprise data centre.</p></div><div class="grid3"><div class="card tilt " style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M23 6l-9.5 9.5-5-5L1 18"/><path d="M17 6h6v6"/></svg></span><h3>High power density</h3><p>Ultra-high-density power from 30\u201350 kW per rack for demanding workloads.</p></div><div class="card tilt " style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg></span><h3>Low latency</h3><p>Low-latency connectivity to peering and inference points.</p></div><div class="card tilt " style="--d:0.2s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/></svg></span><h3>Backup power</h3><p>Robust backup power for genuine 24/7 operation.</p></div><div class="card tilt " style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M23 4v6h-6M1 20v-6h6"/><path d="M3.5 9a9 9 0 0114.9-3.4L23 10M1 14l4.6 4.4A9 9 0 0020.5 15"/></svg></span><h3>Infrastructure efficiency</h3><p>Optimised facility PUE and modern cooling to minimise running cost.</p></div><div class="card t