 Tier-grade DC</div></div><div class="ba-r"><div class="m">Energy cost</div><div class="b"><i></i>Higher per-kW in a small server room</div><div class="a"><i></i>Lower per-kW through facility efficiency</div></div></div></div></section>\r\n<section class="pp-sec " id="reviews"><div class="wrap">\r\n<div class="sec-h "><div class="eyebrow">Customer stories</div>\r\n<h2>What our co-location customers say</h2></div><div class="pp-tcards"><div class="tc " style="--d:0.0s"><span class="q">\u201C</span><div class="stars">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</div><p>XcellHost\u2019s managed co-location keeps our servers always up and running, with top-notch security and support.</p><div class="who"><span class="av">AP</span><div><b>Amit Patel</b><span>IT Director</span></div></div></div><div class="tc " style="--d:0.1s"><span class="q">\u201C</span><div class="stars">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</div><p>The reliability and expert management of XcellHost\u2019s co-location has been a game-changer for our business continuity.</p><div class="who"><span class="av">RS</span><div><b>Radhika Sharma</b><span>CTO</span></div></div></div><div class="tc " style="--d:0.2s"><span class="q">\u201C</span><div class="stars">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</div><p>We trust XcellHost for their exceptional co-location services. Their support team is always proactive and efficient.</p><div class="who"><span class="av">VS</span><div><b>Vikram Singh</b><span>CEO</span></div></div></div></div></div></section>\r\n<section class="pp-sec " id="related"><div class="wrap">\r\n<div class="sec-h "><div class="eyebrow">Related services</div>\r\n<h2>Explore more Cloud Infra from XcellHost.</h2><p>Co-Location pairs well with our dedicated compute and private cloud \u2014 all managed from Mumbai, all under one roof.</p></div><div class="grid4 rel-grid"><a class="rel-card " routerLink="/bare-metal-servers" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width=