(() => {
  (typeof ngDevMode === "undefined" || ngDevMode) && i067.\u0275setClassMetadata(ManagedMicrosoft365ContentComponent, [{
    type: Component67,
    args: [{ selector: "xh-managed-microsoft-365-content", standalone: true, changeDetection: ChangeDetectionStrategy64.OnPush, template: '<section class="mm365-content" aria-label="Managed Microsoft 365 details">\r\n  <div class="pp-sec">Overview \u2014 What is Managed Microsoft 365?</div>\r\n  <div class="mm365-cols">\r\n    <p class="pp-ov"><b>Managed Microsoft 365</b> puts the day-to-day operation of your Microsoft 365 tenant in the hands of certified specialists. XcellHost manages licensing, security baselines, users, devices, Teams governance and support so your internal team can focus on the business.</p>\r\n    <p class="pp-ov">We assess the tenant you already have, fix gaps, optimise licence spend and operate it around the clock. Your users keep working in familiar Microsoft apps while you gain one accountable team, local support and a compliant GST invoice.</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class="mm365-app-strip" aria-label="Microsoft 365 services covered">\r\n    <span class="mm365-strip-label">Managed across</span>\r\n    <span><i class="word">W</i>Word</span><span><i class="excel">X</i>Excel</span>\r\n    <span><i class="powerpoint">P</i>PowerPoint</span><span><i class="outlook">O</i>Outlook</span>\r\n    <span><i class="teams">T</i>Teams</span><span><i class="sharepoint">S</i>SharePoint</span>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class="pp-sec">Assess \xB7 Secure \xB7 Manage \u2014 how we run Microsoft 365</div>\r\n  <div class="mm365-stage-grid">\r\n    <article>\r\n      <span class="mm365-stage-tag">01 \xB7 Assess</span><h3>Understand your tenant</h3>\r\n      <p>We review licences, identities, permissions, devices and collaboration settings before making changes.</p>\r\n      <ul><li>Tenant health assessment</li><li>Licence and usage review</li><li>Security gap analysis</li></ul>\r\n    </article>\r\n    <article>\r\n      <span class="mm365-stage-tag">02 \xB7 Secure</span><h3>Build a safer baseline</h3>\r\n      <p>We configure identity, email and data controls around your people, risk profile and compliance needs.</p>\r\n      <ul><li>MFA and access policies</li><li>Email and data protection</li><li>Governance standards</li></ul>\r\n    </article>\r\n    <article>\r\n      <span class="mm365-stage-tag">03 \xB7 Manage</span><h3>Keep everything healthy</h3>\r\n      <p>Our team handles daily administration, user requests, monitoring and continual optimisation.</p>\r\n      <ul><li>Joiner and leaver workflows</li><li>Direct end-user support</li><li>24\xD77 monitoring and response</li></ul>\r\n    </article>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class="pp-sec" id="copilot-pricing">Copilot for Microsoft 365 pricing (INR)</div>\r\n  <p class="pp-ov copilot-pricing-intro">Add Copilot for any user, priced per user / month. Copilot needs an eligible Microsoft 365 plan \u2014 XcellHost can license it standalone or bundle it with Microsoft 365 in one invoice.</p>\r\n  <div class="copilot-price-grid">\r\n    <article class="copilot-price-card">\r\n      <div class="copilot-card-top"><span class="copilot-tier">Copilot</span><span class="copilot-chip">AI Assistant</span></div>\r\n      <h3>Copilot for Microsoft 365</h3>\r\n      <p>Your AI assistant across Word, Excel, PowerPoint, Outlook and Teams, plus Copilot Chat for work.</p>\r\n      <div class="copilot-meta"><div><span>Works in</span><b>All Office apps</b></div><div><span>Billed</span><b>per user / mo</b></div></div>\r\n      <ul><li>Draft &amp; rewrite in Word</li><li>Analyse data &amp; build charts in Excel</li><li>Create decks in PowerPoint</li><li>Summarise &amp; draft in Outlook</li><li>Recap meetings in Teams</li><li>Secure Copilot Chat for work</li></ul>\r\n      <div class="copilot-price"><span>From</span><b>\u20B92,610</b><small>/user/mo</small></div>\r\n      <a href="mailto:sales@xcellhost.cloud?subject=Copilot%20for%20Microsoft%20365">Configure &amp; Buy <span>\u2192</span></a>\r\n    </article>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <p class="pv-note">\u{1F4B3} Indicative INR pricing, per user / month (billed annually, excl. GST). Requires an eligible Microsoft 365 plan. Pay via UPI \xB7 Cards \xB7 NetBanking. GST invoice on every order. Contact XcellHost for exact Microsoft pricing and Microsoft 365 bundles.</p>\r\n\r\n  <div class="pp-sec">Services XcellHost adds on top</div>\r\n  <div class="mm365-addon-grid">\r\n    <article><i>\u2315</i><b>Copilot readiness</b><p>We check your licences, data access and permissions so Copilot is safe, governed and accurate from day one.</p></article>\r\n    <article><i>\u2726</i><b>Licensing &amp; bundles</b><p>Copilot standalone, or bundled with Microsoft 365 Business plans \u2014 on one simple GST invoice.</p></article>\r\n    <article><i>\u2659</i><b>Training &amp; adoption</b><p>Onboarding sessions and prompt playbooks per role so your team actually uses Copilot every day.</p></article>\r\n    <article><i>\u25F7</i><b>Managed support</b><p>Ongoing admin, usage guidance and 24\xD77 helpdesk from our Mumbai team.</p></article>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class="pp-sec">What Copilot does for your team</div>\r\n  <div class="copilot-feature-grid">\r\n    <article><i class="word">W</i><div><b>Write &amp; summarise</b><p>Draft documents and emails from a prompt, rewrite for tone, and summarise long files in seconds.</p></div></article>\r\n    <article><i class="excel">X</i><div><b>Analyse data</b><p>Ask questions of a spreadsheet in plain English \u2014 Copilot spots trends, writes formulas and builds charts.</p></div></article>\r\n    <article><i class="powerpoint">P</i><div><b>Create presentations</b><p>Turn a document or a prompt into a designed deck with speaker notes \u2014 then restyle it in a click.</p></div></article>\r\n    <article><i class="outlook">O</i><div><b>Manage email &amp; meetings</b><p>Summarise threads, draft replies in your voice, and recap Teams meetings with clear action items.</p></div></article>\r\n    <article><i class="copilot">\u2726</i><div><b>Copilot Chat for work</b><p>A secure chat grounded in your work data \u2014 ask questions, get answers, and take action fast.</p></div></article>\r\n    <article><i class="secure">\u2713</i><div><b>Secure &amp; governed</b><p>Copilot respects your existing permissions and keeps your data inside your tenant \u2014 nothing is used to train public models.</p></div></article>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class="copilot-app-heading">\r\n    <div class="pp-sec">Copilot in every app</div>\r\n    <p>See what Copilot does across Microsoft 365</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class="copilot-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Copilot Microsoft 365 apps">\r\n    @for (app of copilotApps; track app.name; let i = $index) {\r\n      <button type="button" role="tab" [class.active]="activeCopilotApp() === i" [attr.aria-selected]="activeCopilotApp() === i" (click)="selectCopilotApp(i)">{{ app.name }}</button>\r\n    }\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class="copilot-app-panel">\r\n    @for (app of copilotApps; track app.name; let i = $index) {\r\n      @if (activeCopilotApp() === i) {\r\n        <div class="copilot-app-copy">\r\n          <h3>{{ app.title }}</h3><p>{{ app.description }}</p>\r\n          <ul>@for (bullet of app.bullets; track bullet) { <li>{{ bullet }}</li> }</ul>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class="copilot-app-shot">\r\n          <div class="copilot-window">\r\n            <header><span>\u2726 <small>COPILOT</small></span><b>{{ app.name }}</b></header>\r\n            <div>\r\n              @for (prompt of app.prompts; track prompt[0]) {\r\n                <article><i>\u2726</i><span><b>{{ prompt[0] }}</b><small>{{ prompt[1] }}</small></span></article>\r\n              }\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <span>{{ app.caption }}</span>\r\n        </div>\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class="pp-sec">Benefits for your business</div>\r\n  <div class="mm365-benefit-grid copilot-benefits">\r\n    <article><i>\u25F7</i><b>Save hours every week</b><p>Copilot handles the first draft, the summary and the busywork \u2014 giving your team time back.</p></article>\r\n    <article><i>\u2197</i><b>Better-quality work</b><p>Clearer writing, sharper analysis and more polished decks \u2014 a helpful second brain for everyone.</p></article>\r\n    <article><i>\u2659</i><b>Everyone works like a pro</b><p>Copilot levels up your whole team \u2014 no special skills or new tools to learn.</p></article>\r\n    <article><i>\u25C7</i><b>Secure by design</b><p>Your data stays in your tenant, honours existing permissions, and isn\u2019t used to train public models.</p></article>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class="pp-sec">From busywork to done in seconds</div>\r\n  <div class="copilot-before-after">\r\n    <div class="copilot-before-copy">\r\n      <p>Before Copilot, the day fills up with the small stuff \u2014 staring at a blank page, wrangling a spreadsheet, rebuilding a deck, and reading through 40-message email threads.</p>\r\n      <p>With <b>Copilot for Microsoft 365</b>, that work becomes a single prompt. Ask, review, tweak, done \u2014 right inside the apps your team already uses.</p>\r\n      <p>The result: less busywork, faster output and more time for the work that actually needs a human.</p>\r\n      <div><span><b>Seconds</b><small>not hours</small></span><span><b>In-app</b><small>no new tools</small></span></div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class="copilot-phones">\r\n      <article class="copilot-phone before"><span>Before Copilot</span><div><p><i>W</i><b>Write the proposal<small>Blank page</small></b></p><p><i>X</i><b>Analyse the data<small>Hours in Excel</small></b></p><p><i>P</i><b>Build the deck<small>From scratch</small></b></p><p><i>@</i><b>Read 40 emails<small>Catching up</small></b></p></div><em>Without Copilot</em></article>\r\n      <strong aria-hidden="true">\u203A\u203A\u203A</strong>\r\n      <article class="copilot-phone after"><span>With Copilot</span><div><p><i>\u2726</i><b>Draft ready \u2713<small>In seconds</small></b></p><p><i>\u2726</i><b>Insights + chart \u2713<small>Auto-generated</small></b></p><p><i>\u2726</i><b>5-slide deck \u2713<small>From your doc</small></b></p><p><i>\u2726</i><b>Inbox summarised \u2713<small>Caught up</small></b></p></div><em>With Copilot</em></article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class="pp-sec">Microsoft 365, managed as one connected workplace</div>\r\n  <div class="mm365-platform-panel">\r\n    <div>\r\n      <span class="mm365-panel-tag">Microsoft cloud productivity</span>\r\n      <h3>One team for your users, apps and tenant</h3>\r\n      <p>Microsoft 365 works best when identity, email, collaboration, devices and data governance are operated together. XcellHost gives you a single support path and consistent controls across the suite.</p>\r\n      <ul><li>One accountable managed-service team</li><li>Policies applied consistently across apps</li><li>Local support with global Microsoft cloud services</li><li>Regular optimisation as your business changes</li></ul>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <img src="/assets/images/orb-microsoft-365.png" alt="Microsoft 365 apps connected through a managed cloud workplace" loading="lazy" />\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class="pp-sec">Secure, governed and continuously improved</div>\r\n  <div class="mm365-security-panel">\r\n    <div><span>Managed security baseline</span><h3>Your tenant should not run on defaults.</h3><p>We translate your business requirements into practical identity, email, collaboration and data controls, then monitor the environment and refine those settings over time.</p></div>\r\n    <ul><li><b>\u2713</b>Identity and access policies</li><li><b>\u2713</b>Email threat protection</li><li><b>\u2713</b>Sharing and guest governance</li><li><b>\u2713</b>Audit-ready operational reporting</li></ul>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class="pp-sec">Who benefits from Managed Microsoft 365?</div>\r\n  <div class="mm365-use-grid">\r\n    <article><i>\u25A6</i><b>Growing businesses</b><span>Scale users without scaling admin overhead</span></article>\r\n    <article><i>\u20B9</i><b>Finance and professional services</b><span>Stronger identity, data and audit controls</span></article>\r\n    <article><i>\u2695</i><b>Healthcare</b><span>Secure collaboration around sensitive information</span></article>\r\n    <article><i>\u2302</i><b>Distributed teams</b><span>Consistent access and support from anywhere</span></article>\r\n    <article><i>\u2699</i><b>Lean IT teams</b><span>Specialist Microsoft skills without more hiring</span></article>\r\n    <article><i>\u2197</i><b>Cloud-first organisations</b><span>Governance that grows with the tenant</span></article>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class="pp-sec">What\u2019s included</div>\r\n  <div class="mm365-included-grid">\r\n    <article><i>\u2713</i><div><b>Tenant administration</b><p>Configuration, service health, user changes and daily operational requests.</p></div></article>\r\n    <article><i>\u2713</i><div><b>Security and governance</b><p>Baseline policies, access reviews, sharing controls and ongoing improvement.</p></div></article>\r\n    <article><i>\u2713</i><div><b>Licence management</b><p>Provisioning, plan guidance, renewals and regular utilisation reviews.</p></div></article>\r\n    <article><i>\u2713</i><div><b>Support and reporting</b><p>Managed helpdesk, escalation to Microsoft and clear service reporting.</p></div></article>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div class="pp-sec">Why buy your Managed Microsoft 365 from XcellHost?</div>\r\n  <p class="pp-ov mm365-why-intro">Buying licences is easy; keeping the tenant secure, efficient and useful takes continual work. XcellHost combines Microsoft expertise, local accountability and round-the-clock operations in one managed service.</p>\r\n  <div class="mm365-why-grid">\r\n    <article><i>\u25C7</i><b>Microsoft expertise</b><p>Experienced specialists across licensing, identity, security and collaboration.</p></article>\r\n    <article><i>24</i><b>24\xD77 operations</b><p>Mumbai-based NOC and SOC support backed by clear escalation paths.<