 <section class="m365-full-overview" aria-labelledby="m365OverviewTitle"><h2 class="pp-sec" id="m365OverviewTitle" style="margin-top:26px">Overview</h2>\r
 <p class="pp-ov">Microsoft runs the Microsoft 365 service. Your mail, files, sites and chats are yours to protect \u2014 Microsoft&#39;s own terms recommend you back them up. Recycle bins and retention policies help with small mistakes, but they sit inside the same tenant, expire on a timer and weren&#39;t built to roll a whole user back to before a ransomware attack. XcellHost Microsoft 365 Backup copies Exchange Online, OneDrive, SharePoint and Teams automatically, several times a day, into immutable, encrypted storage outside your tenant. Restore a single email, a folder, a site or an entire user to any point in time \u2014 to the original location, to a new one, or as a download \u2014 without overwriting what&#39;s still intact.</p>\r
 </section>\r
