 class="tr-l">Power BI Pro (per user)</td><td class="cc-no wc-hl">\u2014</td><td class="cc-no">\u2014</td><td class="cc-yes"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></td><td class="cc-yes"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></td></tr><tr><td class="tr-l">Teams Phone Standard (cloud PBX)</td><td class="wc-hl">Add-on</td><td class="">Add-on</td><td class="cc-yes"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></td><td class="cc-yes"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></td></tr><tr><td class="tr-l">Purview P2 (Advanced eDiscovery, Comms Compliance)</td><td class="cc-no wc-hl">\u2014</td><td class="cc-no">\u2014</td><td class="cc-yes"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></td><td class="cc-yes"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class="pp-sec ice" id="cost-stack"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h rv"><div class="eyebrow">Cost-saving stack</div><h2>Office 365 E3 + Windows 11 CSP + third-party MDM</h2><p>Wins when third-party MDM is already a sunk cost, Windows is on Volume Licensing with SA, and identity is non-Microsoft-first. Microsoft 365 wins for greenfield, mostly-Windows organisations wanting a single pane of glass.</p></div><div class="cfg2-tablewrap"><table class="cmpx"><thead><tr><th class="tr-l"></th><th class="th-tier hl">Office 365 E3 stack (INR/user/mo)</th><th class="th-tier">Microsoft 365 E3 (INR/user/mo)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="tr-l">Productivity suite (Exchange, Office, Teams, SharePoint, OneDrive, Purview P1)</td><td class="wc-hl">1,910 (Office 365 E3)</td><td class="">Included in M365 E3</td></tr><tr><td class="tr-l">Windows 11 Enterprise per-user licence</td><td class="wc-hl">590 (Windows 11 Ent E3 CSP)</td><td class="">Included</td></tr><tr><td class="tr-l">Endpoint management (MDM + MAM)</td><td class="wc-hl">250\u2013550 (Jamf / WS1 / Ivanti)</td><td class="">Included (Intune)</td></tr><tr><td class="tr-l">Conditional Access + MFA</td><td class="wc-hl">Via Okta / Ping (existing)</td><td class="">Included (Entra ID P1)</td></tr><tr><td class="tr-l">Approximate stack total</td><td class="wc-hl">~2,750\u20133,050</td><td class="">3,000</td></tr><tr><td class="tr-l">Savings vs Microsoft 365 E3 (MDM already paid)</td><td class="wc-hl">~\u20B9800/user/mo when MDM is sunk cost</td><td class="cc-no">\u2014</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class="pp-sec" id="when"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h rv"><div class="eyebrow">When it\u2019s right</div><h2>When Office 365 Enterprise is the right choice</h2></div><div class="grid4"><div class="card rv"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><rect x="9" y="9" width="6" height="6"/><path d="M9 1v3M15 1v3M9 20v3M15 20v3M20 9h3M20 14h3M1 9h3M1 14h3"/></svg></span><h3>Mac-heavy organisation on Jamf</h3><p>60\u2013100% Apple fleet managed by Jamf Pro \u2014 Intune in Microsoft 365 E3 gives you nothing. Office 365 E3 + Jamf is the right stack.</p></div><div class="card rv"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8l-6-6z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h8"/></svg></span><h3>Existing Volume Licensing for Windows 11</h3><p>A 3- or 5-year EA/MPSA with per-device Windows 11 Enterprise SA \u2014 Microsoft 365 E3 double-pays. Saves \u20B9500\u2013800/user/mo.</p></div><div class="card rv"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0110 0v4"/></svg></span><h3>Non-Microsoft identity (Okta, Ping, Workspace)</h3><p>Conditional Access, MFA and SSPR come from your IdP; Entra ID P1 is redundant. Office 365 E3 with Entra ID Free federated to your IdP.</p></div><div class="card rv"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2l8 3v6c0 5.5-3.5 9.7-8 11-4.5-1.3-8-5.5-8-11V5l8-3z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><h3>Regulated industry with existing EDR</h3><p>CrowdStrike, SentinelOne or Sophos already on endpoints \u2014 Office 365 E5 gives Defender for Office 365 P2 + Purview P2 + Teams Phone + Power BI for \u20B91,770/user/mo less than M365 E5.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pp-sec ice" id="industries"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h rv"><div class="eyebrow">By industry</div><h2>Office 365 Enterprise by industry</h2></div><div class="grid3"><div class="card rv"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 3h12M6 8h12M14 3c0 5-4 6-8 6l7 9"/></svg></span><h3>BFSI</h3><p>Office 365 E5 + separate Defender for Endpoint P2 + volume-licensed Windows 11. RBI CSF-aligned: anti-phishing, DLP for PAN/Aadhaar, Communication Compliance for trading desks, India data residency.</p></div><div class="card rv"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2l8 3v6c0 5.5-3.5 9.7-8 11-4.5-1.3-8-5.5-8-11V5l8-3z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><h3>Healthcare</h3><p>Office 365 E5 + Defender for Endpoint P1 + existing Windows. DPDPA/HIPAA-aligned labels for patient data, DLP for PHI, F3 for nursing aides.</p></div><div class="card rv"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8l-6-6z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h8"/></svg></span><h3>Legal</h3><p>E5 for partners needing Advanced eDiscovery with custodian holds and predictive coding; E3 for paralegals. Information barriers between adverse-party teams. Mac fleets on Jamf.</p></div><div class="card rv"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2l10 5-10 5L2 7l10-5z"/><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5M2 17l10 5 10-5"/></svg></span><h3>IT services / GDCs</h3><p>Office 365 E3 for 2,000\u201310,000 engineers on Workspace ONE/Jamf, E5 for compliance/security, F3 for shift NOC. Federation to Okta for client isolation.</p></div><div class="card rv"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><rect x="9" y="9" width="6" height="6"/><path d="M9 1v3M15 1v3M9 20v3M15 20v3M20 9h3M20 14h3M1 9h3M1 14h3"/></svg></span><h3>Manufacturing</h3><p>E3 for office staff with Windows OEM, F3 for shop-floor on shared tablets. Teams shifts and walkie-talkie; Ivanti or ManageEngine for endpoints.</p></div><div class="card rv"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8l-6-6z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h8"/></svg></span><h3>Media & creative</h3><p>Mac-heavy fleets on Jamf. Office 365 E3 with Teams, Outlook and Office for client deliverables; identity federated from Google Workspace or Okta.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pp-sec" id="why"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h rv"><div class="eyebrow">Why XcellHost</div><h2>List price is the same. The difference is what you get with it.</h2><p>Microsoft list pricing is identical whether you buy direct or through a partner \u2014 with XcellHost, the licence comes with advisory, migration, security design and managed operations.</p></div><div class="cfg2-tablewrap"><table class="cmpx wtbl"><thead><tr><th class="tr-l">Capability</th><th class="th-tier hl">XcellHost</th><th class="th-tier">Direct from Microsoft</th><th class="th-tier">Generic reseller</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="tr-l">Office 365 vs Microsoft 365 TCO advisory</td><td class="wc-inc wc-hl">Included</td><td class="">Self-service</td><td class="">Rare</td></tr><tr><td class="tr-l">Free 5-year licensing TCO model</td><td class="wc-inc wc-hl">Included</td><td class="cc-no">\u2014</td><td class="cc-no">\u2014</td></tr><tr><td class="tr-l">Federation engineering (Okta, Ping, Workspace, AD FS)</td><td class="wc-inc wc-hl">Included</td><td class="cc-no">\u2014</td><td class="cc-no">\u2014</td></tr><tr><td class="tr-l">End-to-end migration execution</td><td class="wc-inc wc-hl">Included</td><td class="cc-no">\u2014</td><td class="">Paid</td></tr><tr><td class="tr-l">Defender for Office 365 (E5) policy design</td><td class="wc-inc wc-hl">Included</td><td class="cc-no">\u2014</td><td class="cc-no">\u2014</td></tr><tr><td class="tr-l">Purview information pr