oin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8l-6-6z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h8"/></svg></span><h3>Teams Approvals</h3><p>Leave, expense, shift-swap and operational sign-offs inside Teams \u2014 Approve/Reject with a full audit trail, replacing email chains.</p></div><div class="card rv"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75"/></svg></span><h3>Teams Praise</h3><p>Built-in recognition badges workers and managers post in chat \u2014 a powerful retention tool for hourly-wage workforces.</p></div><div class="card rv"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2l10 5-10 5L2 7l10-5z"/><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5M2 17l10 5 10-5"/></svg></span><h3>Viva Connections</h3><p>A single corporate feed inside Teams \u2014 news, role-based dashboards and leadership messages for workers who never open intranet portals.</p></div><div class="card rv"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 15l4-4 3 3 5-6"/></svg></span><h3>Power BI Frontline (F3)</h3><p>Consumption-only dashboards for managers \u2014 store KPIs, plant OEE, ward census \u2014 paired with Power BI Pro on E5 for authors.</p></div><div class="card rv"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8l-6-6z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h8"/></svg></span><h3>Lists & Forms<