s and admins on E3/E5 (1:8).</p></div><div class="card rv"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75"/></svg></span><h3>Hospitality</h3><p>Housekeeping, F&B and kitchen on F1 with shared iPads; Walkie-Talkie between rooms and kitchen; Tasks for HACCP logs. Supervisors on F3; GMs on E3/E5.</p></div><div class="card rv"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M23 4v6h-6M1 20v-6h6"/><path d="M3.5 9a9 9 0 0115-3.4L23 10M1 14l4.5 4.4A9 9 0 0020.5 15"/></svg></span><h3>Field service</h3><p>Utility, telco and delivery technicians on F3 \u2014 offline mobile Office for work orders and drawings, Power Apps forms with offline cache, Defender P1 on rugged mobiles, Shifts for on-call rota.</p></div><div class="card rv"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M2 12h20M12 2a15 15 0 010 20M12 2a15 15 0 000 20"/></svg></span><h3>Public sector</h3><p>Police, traffic and field inspectors on F1/F3 with rugged Intune-compliant devices; command-channel Walkie-Talkie, Tasks for duty briefings, Forms for incident capture. Senior officers on E3 with PIM.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pp-sec ice" id="shared-devices"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h rv"><div class="eyebrow">Shared device strategy</div><h2>Personal vs shared device \u2014 3-year TCO for 1,000 workers</h2><p>Illustrative 4-shift pattern; hospitals run 1:3, 24\xD77 retail 1:2. We model your exact pattern at proposal.</p></div><div class="cfg2-tablewrap"><table 