-3z" /><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4" /></svg></i>\r\n        <h3>Built for identity security</h3>\r\n        <p>Protect against configuration drift and privilege escalation with secure, incremental backups. Everything is encrypted in transit and at rest, fully auditable, and easily restored for complete control over your Microsoft 365 identity layer.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="entra-objects-title">\r\n    <header class="section-heading">\r\n      <span>Comprehensive protection</span>\r\n      <h2 id="entra-objects-title">Everything that keeps Microsoft 365 secure and connected.</h2>\r\n      <p>Protect the most critical elements of your Entra ID environment, so you maintain continuity of access and recover quickly from accidental misconfigurations or security incidents.</p>\r\n    </header>\r\n    <div class="object-grid">\r\n      <div class="object-chip"><i aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l8 3v6c0 5.5-3.5 9.7-8 11-4.5-1.3-8-5.5-8-11V5l8-3z" /><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4" /></svg></i><b>Conditional Access Policies</b></div>\r\n      <div class="object-chip"><i aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2" /><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4" /><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75" /></svg></i><b>Users</b></div>\r\n      <div class="object-chip"><i aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 2l-2 2m-7.6 7.6a5.5 5.5 0 11-7.8 7.8 5.5 5.5 0 017.8-7.8zm0 0L19 3m-4 4l3 3" /></svg></i><b>Roles</b></div>\r\n      <div class="object-chip"><i aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2" /><path d="M12 18h.01" /></svg></i><b>Devices</b></div>\r\n      <div class="object-chip"><i aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l10 5-10 5L2 7l10-5z" /><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5M2 17l10 5 10-5" /></svg></i><b>Groups</b></div>\r\n      <div class="object-chip"><i aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" /><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0110 0v4" /></svg></i><b>BitLocker Keys</b></div>\r\n      <div class="object-chip"><i aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1" /><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1" /><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1" /><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1" /></svg></i><b>App Registrations</b></div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <section class="content-section section-tinted" aria-labelledby="entra-results-title">\r\n    <header class="section-heading compact-heading">\r\n      <span>Customers love it</span>\r\n      <h2 id="entra-results-title">Less manual work. Faster recovery.</h2>\r\n      <p>What teams see when identity backup is automated and managed rather than scripted by hand.</p>\r\n    </header>\r\n    <div class="stats-grid">\r\n      <div><b>95%</b><span>saved time on manual tasks through automation</span></div>\r\n      <div><b>94%</b><span>reduced ticket volumes and resolution times</span></div>\r\n      <div><b>82%</b><span>replaced 3-4 tools with XcellHost</span></div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <section class="content-section section-tinted" aria-labelledby="entra-features-title">\r\n    <header class="section-heading">\r\n      <span>Secure, automated protection</span>\r\n      <h2 id="entra-features-title">Secure, automated protection for Entra ID.</h2>\r\n      <p>Continuity, recovery, integrity, visibility, security and automation: the six things a real identity backup has to get right.</p>\r\n    </header>\r\n    <div class="card-grid three-columns feature-grid">\r\n      <article class="light-card"><i class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2" /></svg></i><h3>Identity continuity</h3><p>Ensure uninterrupted access to Microsoft 365 by backing up critical Entra ID components (users, groups, roles and access policies) so accidental deletions or misconfigurations do not lock users out.</p></article>\r\n      <article class="light-card"><i class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z" /></svg></i><h3>Access recovery made simple</h3><p>Recover directory objects in minutes with point-in-time restore. Get your organisation back online fast after disruptions, attacks or administrative errors.</p></article>\r\n      <article class="light-card"><i class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M23 4v6h-6M1 20v-6h6" /><path d="M3.5 9a9 9 0 0114.9-3.4L23 10M1 14l4.6 4.4A9 9 0 0020.5 15" /></svg></i><h3>Configuration integrity</h3><p>Automatically capture updates to roles, applications and Conditional Access policies to prevent configuration drift and maintain consistent security baselines.</p></article>\r\n      <article class="light-card"><i class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1" /><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1" /><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1" /><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1" /></svg></i><h3>Centralised visibility</h3><p>Manage Entra backups alongside all your SaaS, endpoint and server protection from one unified console, with the same streamlined experience for IT teams and MSPs.</p></article>\r\n      <article class="light-card"><i class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" /><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0110 0v4" /></svg></i><h3>Security you can trust</h3><p>All backups are encrypted, access-controlled and fully auditable, giving you confidence that your identity data stays protected at every step.</p></article>\r\n      <article class="light-card"><i class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17.5 19a4.5 4.5 0 000-9 6 6 0 00-11.6 1.5A3.8 3.8 0 006.5 19h11z" /></svg></i><h3>Cloud-native automation</h3><p>Eliminate manual exports and guesswork. Automated, policy-driven backup and restore workflows run seamlessly in the background to reduce management overhead.</p></article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <section class="content-section section-dark chance-section" aria-labelledby="entra-chance-title">\r\n    <div class="chance-band">\r\n      <i class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l8 3v6c0 5.5-3.5 9.7-8 11-4.5-1.3-8-5.5-8-11V5l8-3z" /><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4" /></svg></i>\r\n      <h2 id="entra-chance-title">Do not leave identity recovery to chance.</h2>\r\n      <p>Entra ID governs who can access what in Microsoft 365, but its native recovery options are limited. XcellHost Entra Backup ensures that foundation stays intact, so even if identity data is lost or compromised, recovery is fast, complete and under your control.</p>\r\n      <a class="primary-action" href="#ppCtaT">Protect my Entra ID <span aria-hidden="true">\u2192</span></a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="entra-value-title">\r\n    <header class="section-heading">\r\n      <span>The value</span>\r\n      <h2 id="entra-value-title">A common misconception: Microsoft has it covered.</h2>\r\n      <p>It does not. Understanding how to back up Entra ID before an incident is what separates a fast recovery from hours of detective work.</p>\r\n    </header>\r\n    <div class="card-grid four-columns">\r\n      <article class="value-card"><i class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l8 3v6c0 5.5-3.5 9.7-8 11-4.5-1.3-8-5.5-8-11V5l8-3z" /></svg></i><h3>Microsoft runs the platform</h3><p>Microsoft keeps Entra ID available and secures the service, but it explicitly states that unintended deletions and misconfigurations will happen and you must prepare for them.</p></article>\r\n      <article class="value-card"><i class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" /><path d="M12 6v6l4 2" /></svg></i><h3>30 days, then gone</h3><p>Deleted Entra objects are recoverable for only 30 days. Miss the window and they are permanently lost: permissions, groups, everything.</p></article>\r\n      <article class="value-card"><i class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 2l-2 2m-7.6 7.6a5.5 5.5 0 11-7.8 7.8 5.5 5.5 0 017.8-7.8zm0 0L19 3m-4 4l3 3" /></svg></i><h3>Identity data is yours</h3><p>A common misconception is that Microsoft protects your Entra ID data and configuration state. It does not: that responsibility is yours.</p></article>\r\n      <article class="value-card"><i class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M10.3 3.9L1.8 18a2 2 0 001.7 3h17a2 2 0 001.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 00-3.4 0z" /><path d="M12 9v4M12 17h.01" /></svg></i><h3>Native is not backup</h3><p>No long-term retention, no air gap from a tenant compromise, and limited granular recovery: the gaps a real backup fills.</p></article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <section class="content-section related-section" aria-labelledby="entra-related-title">\r\n    <header class="section-heading">\r\n      <span>Related services</span>\r\n      <h2 id="entra-related-title">Protect the rest of your Microsoft estate.</h2>\r\n      <p>Pair Entra ID backup with Microsoft 365 backup, DR and security, all managed by XcellHost, all on one invoice.</p>\r\n    </header>\r\n    <div class="card-grid four-columns">\r\n      <a class="related-card" routerLink="/microsoft-365-backup"><i class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2" /><path d="M3 7l9 6 9-6" /></svg></i><h3>Microsoft 365 Backup</h3><p>Protect Exchange, SharePoint, OneDrive and Teams data.</p><b>Explore <span aria-hidden="true">\u2192</span></b></a>\r\n      <a class="related-card" routerLink="/clo